      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I have a clear picture. The original test has several understandability issues:\n- Many unused imports\n- Unused `data_plus()` and `data_minus()` helper methods that add confusion\n- No visual grouping between H1 and H2 assertions\n\nLet me write the improved version.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version removes all unused imports and the irrelevant `data_plus`/`data_minus` helper methods, and adds two brief comments that visually separate the H1 assertions (months 1–6) from the H2 assertions (months 7–12), making the intent of each group immediately clear."
